  - m_Id: 98851049472
    m_Localized: 'What you are about to see and hear may cause intense fear, anxiety,
      and disorientation.

      We are not responsible for your peace of mind, sleepless
      nights, or a broken keyboard.

      The fictional world of this game has nothing
      to do with reality at least, we hope so.

      Put on your headphones and
      turn off the lights.

'
